; Everything cosmetic about the ring -- canvas, ropes, turnbuckles, posts,
; apron detail, steel steps -- is generated by this, for the reasons its own
; header gives. What stays authored here is exactly what is NOT cosmetic:
; Floor/CollisionShape3D, the four RopeCollision* bodies in the group
; "ring_ropes" that wrestler_controller.gd bounces off, and
; Floor/MeshInstance3D, whose node path capture_harness.gd keys blue for the
; silhouette mask and test_wrestler_colorway.gd reads the mat's albedo from.
; The builder re-meshes that node in place; it never renames or reparents it.
[node name="RingBuilder" type="Node3D" parent="."]
script = ExtResource("3_ring_builder")
